{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8586f656-aa65-8ee7-aae6-addc56933996",
  "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:13:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Erin Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:11:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:12:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Sidewalk problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:12:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a sidewalk problem. Can you tell me where it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:12:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "395 Dixon Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:12:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "395 Dixon Street, in the North End. And what's going on with the sidewalk there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:12:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's heaved up. I tripped on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:12:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry. Heaved up, like a slab lifted? Are you okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:12:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Slab, yeah. Roots, probably."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:12:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And is it right at the edge of the street, or more toward the houses?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:12:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right in the bike lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:12:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In the bike lane, okay. So that's a hazard for riders too. Let me write that down. Did you try reporting it online first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:12:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Website, yes. Rather talk to a person."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:12:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I can take it right here. So what would you like us to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:12:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Add it to the repair list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:13:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put it on the list for 395 Dixon Street, a heaved sidewalk slab in the bike lane, with a trip reported. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:13:10-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:13:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Are you the homeowner there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:13:14-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Landlord."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:13:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, landlord. Do you want a call back when someone's looked at it? I can use the number I have if it comes up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:13:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0196."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:13:26-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0196. Got it. Someone from the department will look at it and be in touch. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:13:33-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:13:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care on that sidewalk until then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T11:13:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Bye."
    }
  ],
